  "track.coroutines.m.flowpipe.co.latest": "`conflate` and `buffer` do not cancel processing that has already started; to cancel it when a new value arrives, use `collectLatest`. [[src:kt-flow-ops]]",
  "track.coroutines.m.flowpipe.co.seq": "By default a cold flow runs in the same coroutine context as its collector, so emitting and collecting are sequential with respect to each other. [[src:kt-flow]]",
